ATTRIBUTION FOR SCOPE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The grammar-point inventory these decks cover -- which patterns, at which JLPT
level -- follows the list published at https://jlptgrammarlist.neocities.org/.
That site supplied the syllabus only. No text, example sentence or translation
from it appears here. It is unaffiliated with this project and has not reviewed
or endorsed it.
